# sapintegrationsuite_provider_feature (Data Source)

Returns one feature of the catalog compiled into this provider version, for example to fail a
plan with a `precondition` when a feature the configuration needs is not `supported`. Needs no
SAP credentials.

**Status:** supported. Needs no SAP connection.

An unknown key fails the plan; `sapintegrationsuite_provider_features` lists every key.

